      "summary": "ValidationRecord's AGREES_WITHIN_UNCERTAINTY/OUTSIDE_UNCERTAINTY guard in models.py checks that ANY reference_value in the case has an uncertainty, not that the reference_value for the specific quantity being compared does \u2014 allowing an uncertainty-based status to be attached to a comparison whose own quantity has no source-reported uncertainty, as long as an unrelated reference_value in the same case happens to carry one."
    },
